{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id207178838"}, "name":{"label":"Dr Jim Morgan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-01T19:57:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"13703322018"}, "title":{"label":"Very inaccurate. My wife and I have the same Pedometer."}, "content":{"label":"We walked the same distance and come up with totally the different results. Also, the calculation 4 miles one day takes. A certain number of steps and the next day it may take three or 400 more or less. To have the same mile. I wouldn’t mind if it was just off a few steps, but it’s off 500 steps from one day to the next.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
