{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28879432"}, "name":{"label":"Mat25000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-29T13:32:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"13690554889"}, "title":{"label":"My ONLY complaints"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app! It’s intuitive and easy to learn. I think it tracks steps better than the iPhone Health app. I love how easy it is to create a workout and export it. Here though is my complaint. I used to be able to share my workouts w my family by text. Now when I hit the share button, choose text, choose my wife, the text opens with no image of the workout and the send button is absent. This brings up my second and possibly most annoying complaint. There is no way to contact the developers!! If it isn’t covered in the FAQ it seems you out of luck. I’m hoping one of them will see this and give the solution or better fix the no communication problem. Otherwise would be 5 stars.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1775949711"}, "name":{"label":"Do-it-now"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-27T23:02:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"13684262223"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn't store step count with workout data."}, "content":{"label":"If you want keep track of the number of steps taken during a workout. You will need to; make a note of the daily step count before you start the workout, perform the workout, note the daily step count after the workout, subtract. \n\nOr, use a different app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1223831027"}, "name":{"label":"Ol'_Man"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-27T20:12:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"13683898053"}, "title":{"label":"Poor or “no” customer service"}, "content":{"label":"Up until Tuesday, January 21, 2026 since 2019 I had been a faithful user and advocate for Pedometer++. However, on Tuesday, 27, 2026 I closed my account and deleted all the data from my iPhone. This was after sending an email to customer support and received no response … the app stopped working following their most recent update. I dutifully followed the instructions, multiple times to no avail. Since I was paid through January 2027 I am not a happy customer and as stated “no customer support”. I am no searching for a comparable product that actually has customer support.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
